1
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:07,920
Leafy: Hmm... aha! Ice Cube! Come on down, you can be my ally.

2
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:09,440
Thanks for picking me!

3
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:12,640
Pencil wouldn't let me into HER alliance.

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,440
Then *I* choose Pencil.

5
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:19,060
Okay then... Who should I choose, Ice Cube?

6
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:21,620
I dunno! It's up to you!

7
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,860
'Kay, then I'll choose TD.

8
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,460
The silent type, right?

9
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,380
What! Don't you, like, not talk?

10
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:33,980
Teardrop must be STUPID! She doesn't even know how to talk yet.

11
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,260
Flower. Be nice!

12
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:40,140
Snowball, you're strong! Beat 'er up!

13
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:43,140
What? You won't? What a wimp.

14
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:48,800
That Flower is starting to REALLY get on my nerves!

15
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,200
Oh! Flower!

16
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:52,660
I'll do it! I'll beat her up!

17
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:55,260
Uh-oh! No way! Not again!

18
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,860
Go Blocky!

19
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,100
Okay, Pin's turn.

20
00:00:58,820 --> 00:00:59,620
Say Bubble!

21
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:00,320
Bubble.

22
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,460
Yeah!

23
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,080
Hmmm.

24
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:05,800
How about Needle?

25
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:06,520
Oka—

26
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,580
NEEDLE!

27
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:08,540
Yeah!

28
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:12,300
Since Match is in OUR alliance, we choose her!

29
00:01:12,580 --> 00:01:14,520
Gasp! They remembered!

30
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:16,140
Come on, people.

31
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:17,220
Pick a boy.

32
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:19,000
How about Snowball?

33
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:21,480
Ooo! They're in LOVE.

34
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:25,200
No, Blocky! I like Coiny more.

35
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,100
*gasp*

36
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,140
*gasp*

37
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:29,100
Did you just SAY that?

38
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,920
I didn't mean to!

39
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:31,940
Pen, guys?

40
00:01:31,940 --> 00:01:33,140
- Yeah.
- Okay, Pen.

41
00:01:33,680 --> 00:01:34,500
Hnnn!

42
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:36,500
HnnnNNNNnnn!

43
00:01:36,580 --> 00:01:37,460
Settle down!

44
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:39,480
Now it's time to pick someone else!

45
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:43,880
Why don't we pick Coiny since Needle likes him more!

46
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,700
Look! I'm sorry!

47
00:01:45,940 --> 00:01:48,100
Is it really that big of a deal?

48
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,800
Firey! Get over here!

49
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:53,300
- Hey! I didn't approve of that—
- And what makes YOU the leader of the group?

50
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:56,760
Yeah, Match! You made a good choice!

51
00:01:57,020 --> 00:01:59,380
Yeah, right. As IF.

52
00:02:00,880 --> 00:02:03,060
Okay! Who's left?

53
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:06,440
There's always TB! He's smart.

54
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,400
Back to Pin's team.

55
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,100
Hmmm.

56
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:11,260
Uhhh...

57
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:12,520
Well...

58
00:02:12,700 --> 00:02:14,260
Pin: Gee, hmmm.

59
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,640
Pin: I don't know...

60
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:17,940
- Pin: Hmm.
- Come on, Pin. Choose!

61
00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:19,040
I don't know!

62
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,440
Pin: They're all pretty bad.

63
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:24,140
Pin: First of all, I wouldn't choose Flower for obvious reasons.

64
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:27,640
Pin: Eraser thinks he's too cool to do anything.

65
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:30,180
Pin: Blocky? No way. He's got issues.

66
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:34,160
Pin: Spongy is soooooo fat and smelly!

67
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,920
Pin: Golf Ball? Too bossy.

68
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,920
Speak to yourself, Pin!

69
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:38,420
Pin: Shush.

70
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:41,600
Pin: Rocky? Seriously? He has no arms!

71
00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:43,780
Pin: And Woody is scared of everything!

72
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:47,980
*Woody screaming nervously*
Sharp things, fire—ouch!—even Bubble!

73
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:50,080
So then, who'll it be?

74
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,540
Uhh,

75
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,360
*sigh*

76
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:55,560
Eraser is the least horrible, I guess.

77
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:59,200
All: We choose Golf Ball!

78
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,780
*1, 2, 3, 4, 5!*

79
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:05,480
- Blocky! Our friend!
- Blocky! Our friend!

80
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:08,020
Aw, really.

81
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,200
Yeah!

82
00:03:10,660 --> 00:03:13,860
See, you know how Flower gets angry at everyone?

83
00:03:13,860 --> 00:03:16,880
Uhm, I don't like where this is going but yeah?

84
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:21,600
Well, if the other team gets her, she'll become MORE of an enemy, right?

85
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:22,540
Y-yeah?

86
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:25,960
So it would just be common sense to choose her for OUR team.

87
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,640
Aw, seriously?

88
00:03:27,780 --> 00:03:29,040
- Yeh.
- I agree.

89
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:32,900
See? I knew TB and GB had a crush on each other!

90
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:35,120
TB! GB! Sitting in a tree!

91
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,180
K-I-S-S-I-N-G!

92
00:03:37,260 --> 00:03:38,300
Shut it, Coiny!

93
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:41,340
I only like Tennis Ball in an platonic way!

94
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:43,320
Back to Pin's team.

95
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:48,280
Well, we definitely don't wanna pick SPOOONGY!

96
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:50,220
What was THAT for?

97
00:03:51,780 --> 00:03:52,500
*1, 2.*

98
00:03:52,580 --> 00:03:56,640
Oh, uhh, sorry, Woody. I choose Rocky.

99
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:58,420
Oh no!

100
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,800
WwwwwWWW!

101
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:03,020
WwwWWwwwwOOOOOoody!

102
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:05,280
BbbBLEH!

103
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,440
Okay. Teams are settled, then.

104
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:11,240
Now, teams. Choose your team name.

105
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:13,860
*indistinct chatter*

106
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,460
Come on! Just choose.

107
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:24,180
*more indistinct chatter*

108
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,180
Okay, then. I'll choose.

109
00:04:26,180 --> 00:04:28,720
Announcer: Pin's Team, you'll be called the Squishy Cherries.

110
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,820
Blocky: Aw, come on!

111
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:32,420
Announcer: And Leafy's Team, you are the Squashy Grapes.

112
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:38,280
The first contest is to build a boat, get in it, and row it across the Goiky Canal.

113
00:04:38,780 --> 00:04:41,760
Announcer: If you are the first to cross the line, your team wins.

114
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:45,820
Announcer: The other team loses, and one of their members gets kicked out of the game.

115
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:52,260
*continued indistinct chatter*

116
00:04:52,280 --> 00:05:00,080
Guys. I have a plan. They're letting us use stuff from the pile of junk. We can use this generator to power the motor and the...

117
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:08,000
*indistinct chatter drowns out her plan*

118
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,200
Hey, hey?

119
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,180
Are you even listening to me?

120
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:14,960
Hey! Of course not! We're not using your plan!

121
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,920
It's too confusing to work.

122
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:21,180
I don't care what you say; I'm still trying!

123
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:24,460
SB: I could push you off if I wanted to!

124
00:05:24,820 --> 00:05:25,780
You're lying!

125
00:05:25,780 --> 00:05:28,620
GB: You wouldn't do that! Your tiny teeny-tiny
SB: rrrRRR

126
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:31,380
GB: little brain wouldn't allow such insanity!
SB: RRRRRR

127
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:37,460
*scream*

128
00:05:38,340 --> 00:05:39,520
*ding ding ding ding ding ding ding*

129
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,620
*collective scream*

130
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,340
Uh-oh!

131
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:47,540
Be more careful!

132
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:52,220
Yeeeowwwwch!

133
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:55,300
*bew bew bew bew*

134
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:59,960
Pretty boxy, but okay!

135
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,120
Yeah!

136
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:04,700
I'm waiting for that yacht.

137
00:06:09,060 --> 00:06:09,620
Yeah!

138
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,640
THESE are our oars?

139
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,640
Cool! I'm an oar!

140
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,700
Let's get in!

141
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:21,740
- Motor!
- Flower: Still waiting.

142
00:06:21,740 --> 00:06:26,780
- Needle: We are SO going to win!
- Coiny: Flower! Your yacht! It's drifting away!

143
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:29,420
Flower: I'm not gonna JUMP onto IT.

144
00:06:31,860 --> 00:06:33,600
I feel bad.

145
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:36,700
Well, oh well. I'm starting the motor.

146
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:40,120
TB: Whoa whoaaaa!

147
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:51,700
*loud breathing* Don't keep me under water for thirty seconds!

148
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,960
LEEEEEEAK!

149
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,020
*BITE*

150
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,600
YEEEEOOOOWWWCH!

151
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:02,140
*scream*

152
00:07:02,140 --> 00:07:02,700
*chomp!*

153
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:04,240
Huh?

154
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:06,660
Yeah! Stay there! We need a plug!

155
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:07,860
Huh?

156
00:07:13,540 --> 00:07:14,980
*scream* *thump*

157
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:23,840
*noises*

158
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:26,000
I'm scared!

159
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:30,800
Uh, Icy and Leafy?

160
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:35,200
Hate to break it to ya, but we just passed right by the finish line.

161
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:37,780
Look out! A tree!

162
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,680
WhAAAaaaAT?

163
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:40,080
*scream*

164
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:45,620
Oh this is just great!

165
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,480
*scream*

166
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:51,220
There's too much weight on this sinking boat!

167
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:53,220
We have to throw someone overboard!

168
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,540
Uh-oh!

169
00:07:58,940 --> 00:08:02,100
Buh! Hhh. Huh?

170
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:06,820
Pen: Guys, guys! The finish! It's just twenty-or-so yards away!

171
00:08:06,820 --> 00:08:08,120
Pen: We can swim there!

172
00:08:08,620 --> 00:08:10,180
But I can't swim!

173
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:16,760
Come on, Match! Come swim with us!

174
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:20,220
I can't! I have no energy left.

175
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,120
*indistinct chatter*

176
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,840
Hey! I hear voices!

177
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:27,740
Match: Hey! It's Tennis Ball and Snowball and Needle and Rocky and Teardrop!

178
00:08:27,820 --> 00:08:30,140
Match: Uh, all floating on Spongy.

179
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:38,720
People!

180
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:41,840
Coiny: The other team is also getting close!

181
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:50,500
Bubble: Huh? Wha? Pin! Slow down!

182
00:08:55,420 --> 00:08:55,920
Whoa!

183
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,700
Whoa, whaaoo!

184
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:09,020
*stretching noise*

185
00:09:09,020 --> 00:09:10,020
*thump*
IC: aaAAAaa!

186
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:14,680
*poke!*

187
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:18,580
And Pin's team, The Squishy Cherries, win.

188
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,540
Which means one of the Squashy Grapes is going home.

189
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,820
It's time for you viewers out there to decide.

190
00:09:25,420 --> 00:09:27,680
Here are the people on the Squashy Grapes team.

191
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:32,560
Needle, Rocky, Teardrop, Leafy, Flower, and

192
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:36,340
Golf Ball, Coiny, Snowball, Ice Cube, and Tennis Ball.

193
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,640
Who'll leave first on BFDI?

194
00:09:39,140 --> 00:09:42,180
I don't know. But it's up to you guys to decide.

195
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:55,360
Uh, we should get back now.